CampusClawAiService --> AiProviderRegistry : resolves identity first
CampusClawAiService --> ApiProviderRegistry : optional fallback
AiProviderRegistry "1" o-- "0..*" AiProvider : indexes by ProviderId
CampusMateProvider ..|> AiProvider
ApiProviderRegistry "1" o-- "0..*" ApiProvider : indexes by Api
