CampusMateProvider "1" ..> "0..*" AssistantMessageEventStream : creates per call
MateChatSseParser "1" --> "1" AssistantMessageEventStream : publishes into
MateChatSseParser ..> ModelCostCalculator : calculates usage cost
AssistantMessageEventStream *-- EventStream
